{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require clear front-of-pack religious certification labelling on food & drink",
        "additional_details": "We want recognised religious certification symbols clearly displayed on the front of all food and drink products, so consumers can easily see when an item meets these standards. We also want a simple red line through the symbol to show when a product does not hold a religious certification. Clear, universal front of pack symbols could give everyone straightforward, transparent information when choosing food.",
        "background": "We want the Government to require front-of-pack labelling for all food and drink products that have a religious certification, including halal, non-halal, kosher, and non-kosher. Clear labelling could help everyone make informed choices, including those with religious dietary needs.",
